{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(source venv/bin/activate)",
      "Bash(python scripts/verify_json_output.py:*)",
      "Bash(python scripts/test_full_pipeline_grayscale.py:*)",
      "Bash(python3:*)",
      "Bash(done)",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(cat:*)",
      "Bash(npm start)",
      "Bash(pkill:*)",
      "Bash(find:*)",
      "Bash(grep:*)"
    ]
  },
  "allowedCommands": [
    {
      "description": "允许运行所有测试脚本（无需确认）",
      "command": "python scripts/test_*.py"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行测试脚本中的批量PDF分割测试",
      "command": "python scripts/test_batch_pdf_split.py"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行测试脚本中的图像分割测试",
      "command": "python scripts/test_image_split.py"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行pytest单元测试（无需确认）",
      "command": "pytest backend/tests/*"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行pytest单元测试（详细输出）",
      "command": "pytest backend/tests/* -v"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许生成测试覆盖率报告",
      "command": "pytest --cov=backend/app --cov-report=* backend/tests/*"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行代码格式化工具（black）",
      "command": "black backend/app/*"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行import排序工具（isort）",
      "command": "isort backend/app/*"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行类型检查工具（mypy）",
      "command": "mypy backend/app/*"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行OCR可视化脚本",
      "command": "python scripts/visualize_*.py"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许运行调试脚本",
      "command": "python scripts/debug_*.py"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许查看Python版本",
      "command": "python --version"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许查看pip已安装包",
      "command": "pip list"
    },
    {
      "description": "允许查看pip包详情",
      "command": "pip show *"
    }
  ],
  "_comments": [
    "此配置文件定义了Claude可以无需用户确认就执行的命令",
    "使用通配符(*)来匹配多个命令",
    "建议只添加安全的、非破坏性的命令",
    "如果需要添加新命令，请确保：",
    "  1. 命令不会删除或修改重要文件",
    "  2. 命令不会影响系统安全",
    "  3. 命令的执行结果可预期",
    "",
    "未来可能添加的命令：",
    "  - python scripts/create_calibration.py（校准相关）",
    "  - alembic *（数据库迁移，Phase 3启用）",
    "  - git status/git diff（只读Git命令）"
  ]
}
